OL,3,GNEWSAFarm attraction founders seek
OL,4,Asuccessor to carry on their 26-year
OL,5,Alegacy
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor more than a quarter of a century,
OL,8,FRichard Powell and Martyn Hughes have
OL,9,Fwelcomed families through the gates of
OL,10,FPark Hall Countryside Experience.
OL,12,FThey have watched children grow up,
OL,13,Freturn as adults and then bring their
OL,14,Fown children through the doors.
OL,16,FNow, after 26 years, the pair have
OL,17,Fdecided it is time for somebody else to
OL,18,Ftake the attraction forward.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
